   "text": "- cloud accounts: vCenter wld02 + NSX wld02 (mgmt next)\n- cloud zones: one per region, tag vcfaCapablity:ready\n- flavor profiles small / medium / large\n- image profiles ubuntu22 / ubuntu24 per cloud account\n- projects development / test / production (SPREAD)\n- blueprints + one GitHub app repo per project",
